{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#cor:dc-ch7-2-9","title":"cor:dc-ch7-2-9","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.md","line":329,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex#cor:dc-ch7-2-9","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#def:dc-ch7-2-2]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex","label":"cor:dc-ch7-2-9","line":570,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[compact $\\Rightarrow$ complete]\n\n  \\label{cor:dc-ch7-2-9}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch7-2-2}\n\n  \\dcref{ch7:2.9}\nIf $M$ is compact then $M$ is complete.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d}\n\\sketch A compact metric space is complete. The metric induced by a Riemannian metric agrees with the manifold topology, so compactness of $M$ gives metric completeness and then geodesic completeness by \\cref{thm:dc-ch7-2-8}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</div></section>[compact <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Rightarrow $\">$\\Rightarrow $</span> complete] <p></p><span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636f723a64632d6368372d322d39\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23def%3Adc-ch7-2-2\">↗ def:dc-ch7-2-2</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch7:2.9</span></span>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is compact then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is complete.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d</a> \\sketch A compact metric space is complete. The metric induced by a Riemannian metric agrees with the manifold topology, so compactness of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> gives metric completeness and then geodesic completeness by <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23thm%3Adc-ch7-2-8\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-74686d3a64632d6368372d322d38\">section 1</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-8-step","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-10-lipschitz","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#def:dc-ch7-2-2","title":"def:dc-ch7-2-2","label":"def:dc-ch7-2-2"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d","title":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d","label":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#cor:dc-ch7-2-9","title":"cor:dc-ch7-2-9","tex":"\\begin{corollary}[compact $\\Rightarrow$ complete]\n\n  \\label{cor:dc-ch7-2-9}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch7-2-2}\n\n  \\dcref{ch7:2.9}\nIf $M$ is compact then $M$ is complete.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d}\n\\sketch A compact metric space is complete. The metric induced by a Riemannian metric agrees with the manifold topology, so compactness of $M$ gives metric completeness and then geodesic completeness by \\cref{thm:dc-ch7-2-8}.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#def:dc-ch7-2-2","title":"def:dc-ch7-2-2","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d","title":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}